	Tooltip:
		'''
		Spawns some black tentacles attached to you that will attack nearby enemies
		Pages that you can pick up will rarely drop when the tentacles hit an enemy
		Picking up these pages will temporarily buff the tentacles
		'Don't look'
		'''
}

