		Chance on hitting nearby enemies to attach a life-stealing vein on them
		The chains will remain attached to enemies as long as you are close enough to that enemy
		You can have up to 3 chains on different enemies, and this amount will lower if your health is lower
		'''
}

TotalOrganPackage: {
	DisplayName: Total Organ Package
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Grants the abilities of all organ accessories
		10% increased critical strike chance
		Hitting enemies may attach a set of goo jaws to them to deal additional damage
		Chance on hitting nearby enemies to attach a life-stealing vein that damages them and heals you
		Hitting enemies will sometimes give them a stomach ache, on death they will explode pink bubbles
		While not using items you will charge up a kidney rock, at full charge attacking will launch stones
		Press the Accessory Hotkey to cough up a lingering cloud of smoke
		Enemies caught in the smoke will also cough smoke clouds randomly for a short time
		Summons an ear companion that shoots out damaging sound blasts while you attack
		'''
}

ArteryPiece: {
	DisplayName: Living Artery
	Tooltip: Filled with strange blood
}

CreepyChunk: {
	DisplayName: Monster Meat
	Tooltip: "'Looks almost edible!'"
}

EyeValleyCompass: {
	DisplayName: Fleshy Compass
	Tooltip: Points to the direction of a strange biome in the underworld when held in your hotbar
}

LeechWhipGore: {
	DisplayName: Gore Food
	Tooltip: ""
}

NoseTempleResetter: {
	DisplayName: Nose Idol of Time Reversal
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Reverses time inside of the nose temple when used, resetting all of the combat rooms
		Cannot be used if any players are inside of the nose temple
		'''
}

SnotGlob: {
	DisplayName: Snot Glob
	Tooltip: ""
}

SpookyHellKey: {
	DisplayName: Eye Valley Key
	Tooltip: Unlocks an eye chest in the catacombs
}

SpookyHellSolution: {
	DisplayName: Red & Purple Solution
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Used by the Clentaminator
		Spreads the Eye Valley onto underworld blocks
		'''
}

SentientBeeGun: {
	DisplayName: Eyesore
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires out eye tadpoles that chase enemies but don't deal contact damage
		Right click while holding this to detonate all tadpoles, dealing a lot of damage
		'It's always laying eggs'
		'''
}

SentientBladeTongue: {
	DisplayName: Tongueblade
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hitting enemies with the tongue may confuse them
		Hold down right click to belch out clouds of ichor
		'Which came first, the tongue or the creature?'
		'''
}

SentientBloodRainBow: {
	DisplayName: Uncanine
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Shoots teeth that fly upward and then fall back down towards your cursor
		'It looks severely brain damaged'
		'''
}

SentientCap: {
	DisplayName: Capsworth
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Will sometimes talk to you and make horrible noises while worn
		'You better not be capping'
		'''
}

SentientChainKnife: {
	DisplayName: Puncturing Hornsnake
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Throw out a long returning serpent chain
		The serpent will stick in enemies and inflict bleeding while holding down left click
		If it has been in an enemy for long enough, releasing left click will hemorrhage the enemy
		'Stabbing things with its horn makes it happy'
		'''
}

SentientChik: {
	DisplayName: Pendeloque
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Cries out crystal tears
		'Hope it isn't actually sad'
		'''
}

SentientChumCaster: {
	DisplayName: Goblin Shark Rod
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fish with two bobbers at once
		Able to catch dangerous creatures from the blood lake
		'It snarls at you'
		'''
}

SentientClingerStaff: {
	DisplayName: Moocher Staff
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Creates a massive cursed inferno explosion on the ground that creates fireballs
		'Funny noises come from its flames'
		'''
}

SentientGatligator: {
	DisplayName: Gator Gun
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires bullets extremely wildly and inaccurately
		Will sometimes vomit out meat giblets that explode when they hit enemies
		33% chance to save ammo
		'Half aligator, half gun, and has a mind of its own'
		'''
}

SentientHarpoon: {
	DisplayName: Frogpoon
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Licks enemies, causing them to be slowed a bit
		'May be genetically related to the licker'
		'''
}

SentientImpStaff: {
	DisplayName: Gargoyle Scepter
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons Grug the gargoyle to fight with you
		Only one can exist, and he requires 2 minion slots to summon
		'He's actually a gargoyle, not a grugoyle'
		'''
}

SentientKatana: {
	DisplayName: Conscious Cutter
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hitting an enemy slashes all enemies nearby you
		'It's a mystery how it doesn't get whiplash'
		'''
}

SentientKeybrand: {
	DisplayName: Molar Mauler
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Swing twice, then throw it as a boomerang
		Hitting enemies may permanently lower their defense by 1, up to 15 total
		Deals more damage to enemies below half health
		'Should be brought to a dentist regularly'
		'''
}

SentientLeafBlower: {
	DisplayName: Carrion Chunker
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Rapidly spits out a bunch of different organic chunks that all do different things
		'Heart healthy!'
		'''
}

SentientLeatherWhip: {
	DisplayName: Licker
	Tooltip:
		'''
		7 summon tag damage
		Your summons will focus struck enemies
		Hold down to charge the whip up, giving it longer range and higher damage
		'It tastes everything it hits'
		'''
}

SentientLifeDrain: {
	DisplayName: Soul Sucker
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Siphons souls from enemies near your cursor, which can heal your life or mana
		After absorbing 20 souls, the staff will unleash a powerful aura
		'It looks at you maliciously'
		'''
}

SentientMagnetSphere: {
	DisplayName: Necronomicon Volume II
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Channel a controllable heart that zaps nearby enemies with blood lightning
		The heart grows in size and power the longer it is channeled
		'Caution: May bite'
		'''
}

SentientMineLauncher: {
	DisplayName: Eye Belcher
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires out a giant spread of eye mines that linger on the ground and explode on contact
		Eye mines deal significantly more damage if they are detonated while on the ground
		'Takes great pride in its eyelashes'
		'''
}

SentientOpticStaff: {
	DisplayName: Retina Chomper Rod
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons eye mouths in a circle around you to shoot tears at enemies
		Sometimes they can shoot cursed tears that inflict cursed flames
		'Don't stick your finger in it!'
		'''
}

SentientPaintballGun: {
	DisplayName: Dairy Homunculus
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Shoots out milk from its utters
		'Do NOT drink its milk'
		'''
}

SentientPaladinsHammer: {
	DisplayName: Dave & Mike
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Throw a two-faced hammer that will chase a nearby enemy
		Upon reaching the targeted enemy, it will strike it 3 times before returning to you
		'They won't stop yapping'
		'''
}

SentientPygmyStaff: {
	DisplayName: Goblinoid Staff
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons a group of 4 goblinoids, each with different abilities
		Each group only counts as one minion
		'DO NOT feed them after midnight!'
		'''
}

SentientRavenStaff: {
	DisplayName: Avian's Crux
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons Billy-Bone the raven to fight with you
		Only one can exist, and he requires 3 minion slots to summon
		'Its heart is beating slowly'
		'''
}

SentientRuler: {
	DisplayName: Foot
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Stab enemies with its toenails
		'Is it a foot long though?'
		'''
}

SentientShootius: {
	DisplayName: Sentient Shootius
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons a living eye tendril sentry to shoot beams at enemies
		'It can stare holes through anything'
		'''
}

SentientSkullBook: {
	DisplayName: Necronomicon
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Casts out fast magic skulls that will bite onto enemies
		'Nom nom nom!'
		'''
}

SentientSphereStaff: {
	DisplayName: Living Caduceus
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons winged biomass chunks to attack foes
		After attacking a single enemy for too long, the biomass will chase its target and explode
		'Probably not a symbol of health'
		'''
}

SentientToxikarp: {
	DisplayName: Bubble Belcher
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Spits out toxic bubbles that bounce off of surfaces
		Sometimes spits out special colored bubbles that all do different things
		'Killer fish from valley of eyes!'
		'''
}

SentientVenusMagnum: {
	DisplayName: Ooze Magnum
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires out bile and piercing teeth abhorrently slowly, but speeds up the longer it is used
		Releasing while at maximum fire rate will shoot a giant explosive glob of bile
		'It oozes with power'
		'''
}

SentientWeatherPain: {
	DisplayName: Weather Rooster
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires out giant lingering tornados that can pull enemies in and fling them around
		'Really good at waking people up in the morning'
		'''
}

SentientHeart: {
	DisplayName: Sentient Heart
	Tooltip:
		'''
		A strange heart ripped from a strong monster
		Can bring out the sentient power of certain weapons
		'''
}

BoogerBlaster: {
	DisplayName: Booger Blaster
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Charge up to shoot nasty boogers that slow enemies on hit
		The longer you charge it, the stronger and faster the boogers will become
		Can be charged up to 3 times total
		'''
}

BoogerBook: {
	DisplayName: Snot-Nosed Tome
	Tooltip: Summons a flying nose above you that constantly shoots out boogers
}

BoogerFlail: {
	DisplayName: Snot Ball
	Tooltip: When launched, the booger will detach from the chain and bounce around
}

BoogerStaff: {
	DisplayName: Sneeze Scepter
	Tooltip: Summons fast flying noses that sneeze on enemies
}

BrainJar: {
	DisplayName: Brainy in a Jar
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons brainy the brain to hover around you
		Every minute brainy will explode all of your minions, dealing a ton of damage
		Each explosions damage will scale further based on each individual minion's damage
		Brainy does not take up any minion slots
		'''
}

EyeFlail: {
	DisplayName: Chained Eyes
	Tooltip: Wield two long range eye flails
}

EyeRocketLauncher: {
	DisplayName: I.C.U
	Tooltip: Hold down to shoot explosive eye missles that home on enemies
}

LeechStaff: {
	DisplayName: Swarm Scepter
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summons weak but agile leeches that rapidly damage enemies
		Leeches only take up half of a minion slot
		'''
}

LeechWhip: {
	DisplayName: Leecher
	Tooltip:
		'''
		10 summon tag damage
		Your summons will focus struck enemies
		Hitting enemies will sometimes rip meat chunks off of them
		Picking up these meat chunks will heal a small amount of your health
		'''
}

MouthFlamethrower: {
	DisplayName: Venom Sprayer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Spews out a stream of venomous gas breath
		Ignores 12 points of enemy Defense
		'''
}

Scycler: {
	DisplayName: Scycler
	Tooltip: Throws discs that follow your cursor before returning to you
}

FleshAxe: {
	DisplayName: Flesh Mincer
	Tooltip: Deals more damage to enemies at low health
}

FleshBow: {
	DisplayName: Seer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Converts wooden arrows into clots of blood
		Every 10 shots will fire out a homing eye
		'''
}

FleshStaff: {
	DisplayName: Retina Staff
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Casts eyes that follow your cursor while holding left click
		Release left click to fling the eyes, dealing double their original damage
		Only up to 5 eyes can be active at once
		'''
}

FleshWhip: {
	DisplayName: Eye Lasher
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Your summons will focus struck enemies
		Hitting enemies may lower their defense for a short time
		'''
}

LivingFleshAxe: {
	DisplayName: Living Flesh Mincer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Deals far more damage to enemies below half health
		Striking enemies will fling a bunch of eyes upward
		'''
}

LivingFleshBow: {
	DisplayName: Living Seer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Converts wooden arrows into clots of blood
		Every 20 shots will fire out multiple homing eyes
		'''
}

LivingFleshStaff: {
	DisplayName: Living Retina Staff
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Summon eyes that follow your cursor while holding down left click
		Release left click to fling the eyes, dealing double their original damage
		Releasing left click with maximum eyes active will explode them, dealing massive damage
		Only up to 8 eyes can be active at once
		'''
}

LivingFleshWhip: {
	DisplayName: Living Eye Lasher
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Your summons will focus struck enemies
		Hitting enemies may halve their defense for a short time
		'''
}

MonsterBloodVial: {
	DisplayName: Monster Blood
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Massively increases life regeneration while not moving
		While moving, you gain 5% increased critical strike chance
		'''
}

NerveWhip: {
	DisplayName: Exposed Nerve
	Tooltip:
		'''
		5 summon tag damage
		Your summons will focus struck enemies
		Deals more damage the more enemies it hits, caps after 5 enemies are hit
		'''
}

Sneezer: {
	DisplayName: Sneezer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires out boogers at a constant rate
		Every 10 shots will fire out a larger and faster booger
		'The booger blaster's younger cousin'
		'''
}

SnotArrow: {
	DisplayName: Booger Arrow
	Tooltip: Bounces off of surfaces and enemies
}

SnotBullet: {
	DisplayName: Mucus Bullet
	Tooltip: Ricochets to another nearby enemy on hit
}

SnotMedication: {
	DisplayName: Allergy Medication
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Grants immunity to poisoned, acid venom, and oozed
		Getting inflicted with any of those debuffs will turn it into a positive buff
		'''
}

SnotRocket: {
	DisplayName: Snot Rocket
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Accelerates rapidly as it travels
		Explodes into lingering snot on direct enemy hits
		'''
}

SnotWings: {
	DisplayName: Snot Bug Wings
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Allows flight and slow fall
		'Gross...'
		'''
}

TortumorStaff: {
	DisplayName: Gore Staff
	Tooltip: Summons friendly tortumors that shoot blood globs at enemies
}

TortumorYoyo: {
	DisplayName: Tumor Throw
	Tooltip: Generates damaging chunks around it while used
}

